/*
 * Below is a representative excerpt of the modified ADM U-Net, the redesigned UNet block,
 * and the EMA update using a power‐function based schedule and post‐hoc reconstruction, as
 * described in the paper. Portions of the code are extracted from training/networks.py and
 * train.py of the repository.
